"This article explains how to setup a `ModalAI VOXL 2 "
"<https://www.modalai.com/en-jp/products/voxl-2>`__ to work with ArduPilot.  "
"This also applies to the `VOXL 2 Flight Deck "
"<https://www.modalai.com/products/voxl-2-flight-deck>`__, `Starling 2 "
"<https://www.modalai.com/products/starling-2>`__ and `Starling 2 Max "
"<https://www.modalai.com/products/starling-2-max>`__"
