#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:30
#: 2a37c6d4b3eb45239ff8e303c7d36377
msgid "Learning About the VOXL 2"
msgstr "了解 VOXL 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:32
#: e3b58002c5af44878d1b6f9627fc967c
msgid ""
"The setup and configuration of the VOXL 2 is very different from the other "
"autopilots supported by ArduPilot.  Please consider reading the `VOXL "
"Developer Bootcamp instructions <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-developer-"
"bootcamp>`__ before proceeding further"
msgstr ""
"VOXL 2 的配置方式与 ArduPilot 支持的其他飞控差异很大。建议在继续操作之前先阅读 `VOXL 开发者训练营说明 "
"<https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-developer-bootcamp>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:35
#: 44e77ea07f174b11837e6cf90a78e028
msgid "Connecting to the VOXL 2 via USB"
msgstr "通过 USB 连接 VOXL 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:37
#: 0ab4f5b7f50b459b82e9e8249d68a8c0
msgid "Please follow these instructions to connect an Ubuntu PC to a VOXL2"
msgstr "请按照以下说明将 Ubuntu PC 连接到 VOXL2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:39
#: b8abaad586e5406d90317d4080642714
msgid ""
"Connect a USB C cable from the Ubuntu PC to the autopilot.  On the Starling "
"2 Max, the USB C port is just below the bright green LED on the back of the "
"vehicle"
msgstr ""
"使用 USB C 数据线将 Ubuntu PC 连接到飞控。对于 Starling 2 Max，USB C 端口位于飞行器背面亮绿色 LED 正下方"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:40
#: a75fb14d05794c9b9f26a943bf9a9b7f
msgid ""
"Follow ModalAI's `Setting Up ADB instructions "
"<https://docs.modalai.com/setting-up-adb/>`__"
msgstr ""
"按照 ModalAI 的 `配置 ADB 说明 <https://docs.modalai.com/setting-up-adb/>`__ 进行操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:41
#: 70f1bae77a2f4d90abe53c76caf7d3c7
msgid ""
"If after running \"lsb devices\" an error similar to, \"no permissions "
"(missing udev rules? user is in the plugdev group)\" please see the "
"\"Permission Issues\" section at the bottom of the `Setting Up ADB "
"instructions <https://docs.modalai.com/setting-up-adb/>`__"
msgstr ""
"如果运行 `lsb devices` 后出现类似「no permissions (missing udev rules? user is in the "
"plugdev group)」的错误，请参阅 `配置 ADB 说明 <https://docs.modalai.com/setting-up-"
"adb/>`__ 末尾的「Permission Issues」部分"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:42
#: f809aeffcf65447b83b165dd0f318e88
msgid "Test logging into the VOXL 2 using ``adb shell`` and ``voxl-version``"
msgstr "使用 ``adb shell`` 和 ``voxl-version`` 测试登录 VOXL 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:45
#: 8db94a548f06460cbab71db9113f9795
msgid "Connecting to the VOXL 2 via Wifi"
msgstr "通过 WiFi 连接 VOXL 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:47
#: 45a24ea019b346b5b44239570defa394
msgid "Power on the vehicle or autopilot"
msgstr "为飞行器或飞控上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:48
#: 60d25d80169645559a5cfacac8d965d9
msgid ""
"By default, most VOXL 2 will create a Wifi Access Point soon after startup "
"named \"VOXL-xxxxxxxxxx\" (where \"xxxxxxxxxx\" is the MAC address of the "
"VOXL 2)"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，大多数 VOXL 2 在启动后不久会创建名为「VOXL-xxxxxxxxxx」的 WiFi 热点（其中「xxxxxxxxxx」为 VOXL "
"2 的 MAC 地址）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:49
#: db673353e3164e16a2d051664767f9e6
msgid ""
"Connect to the Wifi Access Point from your PC, the default password is "
"\"1234567890\""
msgstr "从 PC 连接到该 WiFi 热点，默认密码为「1234567890」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:50
#: 6a4719a6dc1647dc9d5ef4cbaccad1f9
msgid ""
"To connect to the `VOXL Web Portal <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-"
"portal/>`__, open a web browser to http://192.168.8.1"
msgstr ""
"要连接到 `VOXL Web Portal <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-portal/>`__，请在浏览器中打开 "
"http://192.168.8.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:51
#: 82337e01a1914f1c9d15ca575268623e
msgid ""
"More details on the Wifi setup can be found `here "
"<https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-2-wifi-setup/>`__"
msgstr "WiFi 配置的更多详情请见 `此处 <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-2-wifi-setup/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:54
#: b5e4f4299cdc4a0ab88f61917ba77ff6
msgid "Installing ArduPilot"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot"

