#: 775d97e7ea9148cfbb27998a4c177e88
msgid ""
"`ModalAI's official instructions for installing ArduPilot are here "
"<https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-ardupilot/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`ModalAI 官方 ArduPilot 安装说明请见此处 <https://docs.modalai.com/voxl-"
"ardupilot/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:58
#: 9d85964dd9394255943b2fd5d5b10921
msgid ""
"Pre-built installation packages (.deb files) for Ardupilot can be found here"
" on firmare.ardupilot.org:"
