"Copter：`最新版 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/latest/QURT/>`__、`测试版 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Copter/beta/QURT/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:61
#: 2d8df6b769044b5d8ca5f0559aae7576
msgid ""
"Plane: `latest <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/latest/QURT/>`__, `beta"
" <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/beta/QURT/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Plane：`最新版 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/latest/QURT/>`__、`测试版 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Plane/beta/QURT/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:62
#: 21f83ff79ade428e9f68e632fe0d6480
msgid ""
"Rover: `latest <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Rover/latest/QURT/>`__, `beta"
" <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Rover/beta/QURT/>`__"
msgstr ""
"Rover：`最新版 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Rover/latest/QURT/>`__、`测试版 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Rover/beta/QURT/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:64
#: 8e9bc19e84d24da78de39dd3a0b474a6
msgid "Install the ArduPilot firmware:"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot 固件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:66
#: 8a32e25ffe0748c9ae7a5676932f8144
msgid "Ensure the Ubuntu PC has a good internet connection"
msgstr "确保 Ubuntu PC 有良好的网络连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:67
#: 84844eb5920547069a3f463a9e8a6a1a
msgid "Connect the PC to the vehicle via USB (see above)"
msgstr "通过 USB 将 PC 连接到飞行器（见上文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:68
#: 53f554c1f90c4c66ab8c902e3bd5099b
msgid ""
"Disable the px4 service using, ``adb shell systemctl disable voxl-px4``"
msgstr "使用 ``adb shell systemctl disable voxl-px4`` 禁用 px4 服务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:69
#: fc6d2b99e00c496f89f9d895cfda5d19
msgid ""
"Open a web browser and click on the \"latest\" or \"beta\" link above that "
"is suitable for your vehicle type and download the .deb package"
msgstr "打开浏览器，点击上方适合你飞行器类型的「最新版」或「测试版」链接，下载 .deb 安装包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:70
#: 462696e1040e40c3bf6c111d6c11e8ff
msgid "Open a terminal and find the .deb package downloaded above"
msgstr "打开终端，找到上述已下载的 .deb 安装包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:71
#: c6233289e74449a8b5d7128fb624d971
msgid ""
"Push the .deb file to the autopilot's root directory using, ``adb push *.deb"
" /``"
msgstr "使用 ``adb push *.deb /`` 将 .deb 文件推送到飞控的根目录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:72
#: e65401f4e56e4df1a8752d7d0a599910
msgid "Log onto the VOXL2 and install the deb package"
msgstr "登录 VOXL2 并安装 deb 安装包"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:74
#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:89
#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:96
#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:107
#: 51426b620ccf4d988116fec22fb59379 5c2d95a42a5d4d1baf3586d3c3d64642
#: a630a7441fca461b9037baa980017f59 e6d7ca290e11445080442337ff24cc98
msgid "``adb shell``"
msgstr "``adb shell``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:75
#: 225ba2cd1284412a828d4325509561f8
msgid "``cd /``"
msgstr "``cd /``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:76
#: 92b99040355b40acb602c0e8f8d01916
msgid "``dpkg -i voxl-ardupilot_*.deb``"
msgstr "``dpkg -i voxl-ardupilot_*.deb``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:99
#: 1b8cf09920f048099e91d50dd7fed19f 5c35a7bd887645b18c4b8afd88a6eaf1
#: afd41b2c82c549dc8d4bc0c67b6be35c
msgid "``exit``"
msgstr "``exit``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:79
#: 9b293871dc5c448c9c81b2d601268396
msgid ""
"Setup the default parameters (optional because you may do it later via a GCS"
" instead):"
msgstr "设置默认参数（可选，也可稍后通过 GCS 完成）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:81
#: 26d4f5942e7f46d4aca1851344d85194
msgid ""
"Download latest parameter files for your frame from `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/Frame_params/ModalAI>`__"
" (be sure to use the \"Download raw file\" button)"
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/Frame_params/ModalAI>`__"
" 下载你机架的最新参数文件（请确保使用「Download raw file」按钮）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:86
#: d59494f50a0e41088f502a0db953127f
msgid ""
"From the Ubuntu PC, push the parameter file to the autopilot's /data/APM "
"directory using, ``adb push *.parm /data/APM``"
msgstr ""
"在 Ubuntu PC 上，使用 ``adb push *.parm /data/APM`` 将参数文件推送到飞控的 /data/APM 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:87
#: cd7f2a629e50443e9e1c6d95e3f59abb
msgid ""
"Log onto the VOXL2 and add a link to the default parameters in /data/APM"
msgstr "登录 VOXL2，在 /data/APM 中添加默认参数的软链接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:90
#: ac4cc7f2fee54ddfa613b0e260bf2141
msgid "``cd /data/APM``"
msgstr "``cd /data/APM``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:91
#: adf19eb649fb4656acd52c951a2eaf07
msgid "``ln -s Starling2Max.parm defaults.parm``"
msgstr "``ln -s Starling2Max.parm defaults.parm``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:94
#: 7071c56272314e1f8441dc8cced729a9
msgid "Log onto the VOXL2 and enable the ArduPilot service"
msgstr "登录 VOXL2 并启用 ArduPilot 服务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:97
#: 97c780d3aba74c2e8b1ee1ceed695b22
msgid "``systemctl enable voxl-ardupilot``"
msgstr "``systemctl enable voxl-ardupilot``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:98
#: d153b2f01bea443cbf96485387232726
msgid "``systemctl start voxl-ardupilot``"
msgstr "``systemctl start voxl-ardupilot``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:101
#: d96ffa74da75485d8b86a36e7b2b9f88
msgid ""
"Reboot the vehicle, connect with a GCS and complete the vehicle setup "
"including accelerometer, compass and RC calibration"
msgstr "重启飞行器，使用 GCS 连接并完成飞行器配置，包括加速度计、罗盘和 RC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:103
#: 62b19f9bc0af42b28dcd4e124c9af6ee
msgid "Disable Figure Eight:"
msgstr "禁用八字飞行："

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:105
#: 94d0fbc9335b4c0b8f2e934f596be7ca
msgid ""
"If the vehicle is changed to Guided mode the VOXL2 may send commands to fly "
"a figure of eight.  This can be disabled using the following commands:"
msgstr "如果将飞行器切换到 Guided 模式，VOXL2 可能会发送命令执行八字飞行。可通过以下命令禁用此功能："

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:108
#: 31ae3ad23ef1448c810b8b91da8157e3
msgid "``cd /etc/modalai``"
msgstr "``cd /etc/modalai``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:109
#: ededdd7544394229b2a1b45a571b75fd
msgid "Use your favourite editor (eg \"vi\" or \"vim\") to edit voxl-vision-hub.conf"
msgstr "使用你喜欢的编辑器（如「vi」或「vim」）编辑 voxl-vision-hub.conf"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:110
#: a8e855b3c5534150b145c69e74725bd1
msgid ""
"Search for \"offboard_mode\" and replace \"figure_eight\" with \"off\" as "
"shown below:"
msgstr "搜索「offboard_mode」，将「figure_eight」替换为「off」，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:112
#: 7d862894f98a46fe881dba50633c4c1c
msgid "``\"offboard_mode\":      \"off\",``"
msgstr "``\"offboard_mode\":      \"off\",``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:115
#: 02b792e8df314baaa8b2cd9e5fc7ac49
msgid "Autopilot Configuration"
msgstr "飞控配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:117
#: 477eb4a1f7734f71baa07d9ac16d65da
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and "
"check that the following parameters are set"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞控，确认以下参数已正确设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:119
#: 29712e220b934a279a25029469b0bab8
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 2 (MAVLink2).  This is the "
"serial port used to connect the autopilot with the vision system"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 2（MAVLink2）。这是用于连接飞控与视觉系统的串口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:120
#: b436c4e460d44bce986ee2dba259a1d4
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 57600 ( baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_BAUD <SERIAL1_BAUD>` = 57600（波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:121
#: 849f0398519a4abb892c76283e5c12e8
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 1024 (Don't "
"forward mavlink to/from) to disable the camera's odometry messages from "
"being sent to the GCS"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS <SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 1024（不转发 mavlink "
"消息），以禁止将相机的里程计消息发送到 GCS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:122
#: dc3bf536877e4fd7896a5273bf362b95
msgid ""
"Optionally set :ref:`MAV3_EXTRA3 <MAV3_EXTRA3>` = 0 to disable sending the "
"SYSTEM_TIME message to the camera which has been known to cause the camera "
"to lose its position estimate (e.g. quality falls to -1).  Note this assumes"
" the camera is connected to the autopilot's second mavlink port (e.g. "
"usually Telem2)"
msgstr ""
"可选设置 :ref:`MAV3_EXTRA3 <MAV3_EXTRA3>` = 0，以禁止向相机发送 SYSTEM_TIME "
"消息（该消息已知会导致相机丢失位置估计，例如质量降至 -1）。注意：此处假设相机连接到飞控的第二个 mavlink 端口（通常为 Telem2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:123
#: 4e13c0f7fa16417bb86018cec5547151
msgid ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 3 (VOXL)"
msgstr ":ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 3（VOXL）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-modalai-voxl2.rst:124
#: 5e43bbf0cc7741b1afce9de8dc857f35
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Y <VISO_POS_Y>` and "
":ref:`VISO_POS_Z <VISO_POS_Z>` to 0 because the VOXL2 already compensates "
"for the camera's position relative to the IMU.  See :ref:`sensor position "
